                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "🍔🥪🥤Mibao Brunch, located opposite Shipai Elementary School, boasts a clean and tidy environment, delicious food, and affordable prices. It\u0027s a simple brunch spot in the area that you\u0027ll want to come back to. 😋👍",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "🍔🥪🥤石牌國小對面的✨米堡早午餐✨環境乾淨整潔，餐點好吃、價格親民，是這一帶讓人吃過會想再來的簡單早午餐店。😋👍",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
