                    {
                        "name":  "places/ChIJLTZo_qivQjQRLJFJSvbVgPA/reviews/ChdDSUhNMG9nS0VJQ0FnTUNRcE5lc3lnRRAB",
                        "relativePublishTimeDescription":  "a year ago",
                        "rating":  5,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "The stir-fried instant noodles were fantastic! I added an egg. The basil egg pancake and milk tea were also great, and we were very full. The basil egg pancake in the picture is already half eaten.\n\nThe kid ordered the #1 set meal, which included chicken balls, crispy fries, and fried dumplings. He said they were all delicious, but the chicken balls were the best—they tasted like chicken nuggets, just small and round. It came with a glass of orange juice with pulp.\n\nThere were even phone holders on the table for guests, which was great.\n\nThe staff were incredibly friendly when serving the food. They even went to the self-service cutlery area to get spoons for us, saying it would be more convenient for eating glass noodles, and they also told us there was soy sauce paste available. It was our first time here, and we were very grateful for the staff\u0027s kind service.\n\nThe only downside was the amount of cooking fumes inside.\n\nThe food was delicious; I\u0027ll definitely come again.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "炒泡麵非常棒！我有加蛋。還有九層塔蛋餅和鮮奶茶，都很好，吃的很飽。圖片中的九層塔蛋餅已經被吃了一半。\n小孩點的1號餐有雞球、脆薯和煎餃，說都好吃，最好吃的是雞球，類似雞塊的味道，只是圓圓小小顆。附一杯柳橙汁有果肉。\n桌上還有放手機架給客人用，真棒。\n店員送餐時超級親切，還主動去自助取餐具的地方拿湯匙給我們，說吃冬粉比較方便，還跟我們說那邊有醬油膏可以加。第一次來，很謝謝店員的親切招呼。\n唯一缺點是內用油煙很大。\n東西很好吃，會再來。",
                                             "languageCode":  "zh-Hant"
                                         },
                        "authorAttribution":  {
                                                  "displayName":  "李小玲",
