                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "I\u0027ve ordered takeout so many times, and the portions are always so full! This time, I left a note asking the restaurant to make it a little smaller. To my surprise, they actually did it! They even drew a heart on the order! Such a great restaurant deserves five stars!",
                                     "languageCode":  "en-US"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
                                             "text":  "外送叫過太多次\n每次份量都飽到不行\n這次備註給店家說希望可以少一點\n沒想到店家真的照我的備註去做\n還在單子上畫愛心～\n這麼好的店家除了五顆星還是五顆星",
